shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> runs Linux and we attempt to determine the locale you have, but default to UTF-8.
You are likely attempting to read in a file without specifying the encoding to use, and your local system (Windows, to take a wild guess?) is handling this better.
You might get more information, such as a line number, by looking at your application's logs <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html#debugging-your-application>.

