Fredrik,

You are correct. shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> does not support any type of account roles, therefore anyone with access to the account has access to all the applications in that account.

I'm afraid I don't have any great ideas for a workaround at this time, as this is how the system is designed to work.

-Andy

